WEBVTT

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.100
My lord...

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.840
You're finally going to be 
my big sister, aren't you?

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.530
Good girl...

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.370
You need to pay some attention to me, too!

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.080
You're a good girl, as well...

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.410
My lord!

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.020
Us, too!

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.360
Good girls!

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.920
But I don't think I'm going 
to make it through this...

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:36.550
M-Me, too!

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:40.350
Here I go!

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.820
<b>Battle Maidens Theatre Opening Soon 
Look Forward to It!</b>

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.410
<b>Safety First</b>

00:02:21.810 --> 00:02:24.410
This goes here, and that goes there...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.300
Kenshin-san, put those there.

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:27.970
OK.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.290
Stop it, both of you!

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:39.930
Hideyoshi is such an entertaining girl.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.430
This year's festival

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:44.680
will be a big success because of her.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.600
It's that time of year when 
we hold an event for the people.

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.660
I see.

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:54.110
So it's festival time already?

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.000
Yes.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:56.760
Let me see...

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.650
Shall we call the mikos and have a dance again?

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.580
Yes, I've made the preparations.

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.310
As always, Shingen-dono and 
Kenshin-dono will be attending,

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:08.330
so I've prepared for that.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:11.350
Well done, Mitsuhide.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:12.920
Thank you...

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.750
U-Um...

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:16.840
What is it?

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.330
A miko's dance is like a religious celebration, right?

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:23.260
What of it?

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.330
If we're arranging it,

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:29.170
why not put on something like a cultural fair?

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.540
A cultural fair?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:31.640
What's that?

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.820
Like a play...

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.690
If you can't explain it, then don't interrupt!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.900
Why not?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.360
Hideyoshi, what is this "play"?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:45.140
It's easier to understand than something religious,

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.410
and I'm sure everyone would love it!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.700
OK! Do this "play," Hideyoshi!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.820
Me?

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:55.520
But there's no stage or script...

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.600
Everyone, let's go!

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:02.840
<i>Why must she always interfere?!</i>

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:07.850
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:07.850
<b>Drama Maiden</b>

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.310
I had no idea how hard it is to make a stage...

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.990
I want to go to bed.

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.710
But I need to write that script!

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.740
Do your best, self!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:23.950
Hey...

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.580
I've heard that for the last three days.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:32.310
Well, I've never written anything 
longer than a text message!

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:34.650
I can't think of a story.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:36.260
Fine.

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.290
I'll give you an idea.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.190
Really?

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:40.300
What kind?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.430
Thank you!

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.550
What a wonderful person!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.530
No, not at all.

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:13.150
More importantly, are you hurt?

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:15.220
I'll never forget this.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:17.330
But how can I repay you?

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.140
Those men took my wallet.

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.570
And my clothes are all torn...

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.110
I've nothing to give you!

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.260
But you do!

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.680
You, yourself!

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:30.420
No way!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.470
Then how about...

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.000
We lose...

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.480
Please, just don't kill us.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.120
Then strip.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.740
That doesn't work, either!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:01.740
Shiro, I want your child.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:03.710
Oh, Shiro!

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:07.080
Idiot!

00:06:07.990 --> 00:06:10.880
Someone, help me with the script!

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:14.090
What should I do?

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:16.250
I can't do this myself...

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.210
Shingen-san, are you there?

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.780
I'd like your help with something...

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.440
Actually, never mind.

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:51.160
What should I do?

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.430
It's almost morning!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.640
I'll never make it!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:58.020
Someone, help...

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.140
I'll help you!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:00.710
Yoshimoto-san?!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.560
You're putting on a play. 
Right, Hideyoshi-chan?

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.440
Why didn't you talk to me?

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:07.330
Um... Well...

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.390
When it comes to the arts, you can count on me.

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:11.200
See?

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.510
<i>Tale of the Bamboo Cutter</i>, the <i>Tale of Ise</i>,

00:07:15.510 --> 00:07:18.730
and a copy of <i>Tale of Genji</i>, 
written down by Murasaki Shikibu herself!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:23.330
Stories of love make the heart grow big.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.770
Would they help you with this "play"?

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.150
They would!

00:07:27.150 --> 00:07:28.410
Like, totally!

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:30.000
I thought so.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:32.320
Yay!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.510
What is this?

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.580
Oh, hello, Mr. Doggy.

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:36.430
That's...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.850
<i>A Tale of Lilies</i>?

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:42.650
I wrote my own story.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.040
Wow!

00:07:44.040 --> 00:07:46.270
You wrote that yourself, Yoshimoto-san?

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:50.140
When I'm having fun with 
Nobunaga-san and the rest,

00:07:50.140 --> 00:07:53.700
all kinds of ideas just come to me!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.020
This is one of those?!

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.530
Naturally, you're in it, too.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.290
Hideyoshi...

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:04.880
My lord...

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.570
Hideyoshi, I love you.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.510
No, I'm not ready yet...

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:09.510
Hideyoshi!

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:10.710
Hideyoshi!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:12.250
No way!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.990
I couldn't do this!

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:15.050
You couldn't?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:17.030
I think it would be perfect.

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:19.390
I couldn't! Ever!

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:23.000
Akerin, save me!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.700
At this rate, I'm going to...

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:26.050
I think it's fine.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:30.300
G-Girls should spend some time 
naked together, once in a while.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.320
That's right.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.060
OK, fine. I'll use it,

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.830
but I'm changing parts, OK?

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.460
I see...

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.430
I was wondering what that old bag was doing,

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:47.490
all the way out at Azuchi Castle.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.840
So that's it.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:55.650
Now, then... What to do 
with this "play" of theirs?

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.220
I have an idea.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:02.350
You've never had a successful plan in your life!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.340
Forgive me!

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:08.860
Now, what to do...

00:09:17.180 --> 00:09:20.880
OK, once that's done, it's ready!

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.300
It would go faster if you had the people help.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:25.590
I can't do that!

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:27.920
They're the audience!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:29.500
Yeah, but...

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.110
Hideyoshi, are you done?

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:33.760
Yes, my lord!

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.630
So, you stand here, my lord.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:38.260
Right.

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.940
And then say your line

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.990
"Mitsuhide, you're in love with me, right?"

00:09:42.610 --> 00:09:44.000
You're in love with me, Mitsuhide?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:48.230
Um, well... No... It's a line in the play!

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.100
Line?

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.030
Like the Noh performances you enjoy.

00:09:51.030 --> 00:09:52.440
A made-up story.

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.190
I see.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.620
A made-up story.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.060
I'm sorry, Mitsuhide.

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.140
I misunderstood.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:57.850
Forgive me.

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:01.120
No, my lord... You're too kind.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.250
Anyway, let's continue!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.200
Yeah!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:13.390
It's a play! It's a play!

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:15.190
Don't take it seriously!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.250
You are too beautiful.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.890
Your face, your form, your legs—

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.730
I'm sorry I'm so beautiful!

00:10:24.730 --> 00:10:28.000
Hey, aren't these clothes a little too plain?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.840
Redo it! One more time...

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:30.940
Come on...

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:34.650
Is this really going to work...

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.320
Shiro?

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.240
Shut up!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.940
It's just getting to the good part!

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.100
Get going!

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:44.030
Jeez.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:50.510
In the next scene, my lord receives 
everyone's love at once.

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:52.690
It's the play's most important scene!

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:54.600
Everyone, let's not get embarrassed!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:02.050
Now then, my lord... Excuse me...

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.730
Yes, come closer.

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.440
Right.

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.890
Hurry.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:15.100
Then let's begin, Mitsuhide!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:16.080
Yes!

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.610
OK, begin...

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:26.080
My lord... You're finally going to be 
my big sister, aren't you?

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.580
Good girl...

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:31.640
You need to pay some attention to me, too!

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:34.140
You're a good girl, as well...

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:35.580
My lord!

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:37.460
Us, too!

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:39.900
Good girls!

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:42.800
But I don't think I'm going 
to make it through this...

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.350
M-Me, too!

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:52.770
No, Shiro!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:02.120
We should totally try that again!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.530
I almost suffocated in Shingen's butt.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.270
You jumped by yourself.

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.740
Shingen-san?

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:30.810
Hey, Hideyoshi.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:34.160
What are you doing out here, Shingen-san?

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.920
Good work today.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.130
You must be tired.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:39.940
Here.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.530
It's a famous food from my land.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.130
You eat it with honey.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.270
Oh, I know this!

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.930
Thank you, Shingen-san!

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:48.510
Not at all!

00:12:49.860 --> 00:12:51.330
Well, you know...

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.870
And not really in exchange, but...

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:58.980
I was thinking I'd kind of like a bigger part.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.930
Well, you know, in the play...

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.840
Especially a bigger part than Kenshin's.

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:06.410
Anyway, thanks.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:07.800
Goodbye!

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:09.180
Shingen-san!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.320
Hey, Hideyoshi!

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:12.260
Kenshin-san.

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:13.350
Good timing.

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:16.590
I saw a beautiful flower.

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.770
I thought it would suit you.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:22.180
Um...

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:26.840
I can't stop thinking about your body.

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.160
<i>Now she's trying to seduce her?!</i>

00:13:31.780 --> 00:13:34.790
You poor thing, just look at your skin...

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:37.370
You've barely slept at all lately, have you?

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:42.980
<i>What? Kenshin-san is... I can't...</i>

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.990
I know!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.850
I've got an idea.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.180
Let's think about the play together.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.040
It's simple.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:53.800
Just give me a little bigger part,

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.300
and I'll demonstrate some sword moves.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:13:57.400
Then...

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.790
F-Fine! I'll do it!

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:02.100
So goodbye!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.820
Hideyoshi, we're not done yet!

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.180
That surprised me!

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.800
I thought she was gonna kiss me!

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.980
What's wrong with that? It wouldn't hurt you.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.070
What, have you never kissed anyone?

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.160
Shut up... Shut up, shut up!

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.220
Sorry, but I never shut up!

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:26.340
Yoshimoto-san? What's that outfit?

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.180
I thought the clothes I had 
for the play were a bit plain.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.590
What do you think of this?

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.810
You're going to wear that for the play?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:36.630
It's still kind of plain...

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.520
Then I'll try this.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.690
Or this!

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.480
Or more bold!

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:45.360
More showy!

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.990
Those got really weird halfway through!

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.870
What to do...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:02.440
If the play fails, Hideyoshi's reputation 
would be ruined.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:03.520
It would be wonderful.

00:15:03.520 --> 00:15:07.210
But if the play succeeds, I can sleep 
with my lord, even if it is in front of everyone!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.510
I can't pass that up!

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:10.480
But if I do that, the play will be a success...

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:13.300
But I can't give up on sleeping with her.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.820
But that means the play's success.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:16.890
But if my lord embraces me...

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:21.940
Everyone's really getting into 
this whole play thing.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.200
And to think, no one had ever heard 
of a play before you told them about it.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.270
Why does it have to be like this?

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:29.970
We should all just have fun.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:32.740
What do you think you're doing, 
pretending to be a good girl?

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:33.870
I am a good girl!

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:35.990
Hey, it's Tokunyan!

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.620
Tokunyan should feel the same way I do.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.030
Hey!

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.220
Tokunyan!

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:44.860
Hideyoshi-san.

00:15:44.860 --> 00:15:47.090
I hope your play goes well.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.990
Right, right?

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.450
Let's all put on a good play and have fun!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:54.040
About that... I had an idea.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.970
How it could be even more fun.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.350
You, too?

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.330
Nobunaga-san goes crazy!

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:09.210
She slices up everyone, and then I beat her!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:11.580
Don't worry.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:15.060
We'll keep it a secret during practice.

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.590
I'll do my best for the real thing.

00:16:17.590 --> 00:16:18.560
Goodbye.

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:25.390
Is Tokunyan actually mean and 
just keeps it hidden?

00:16:25.390 --> 00:16:27.600
Yeah, I think that's her type.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.100
What should we do during the real play?

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:55.220
My normal clothes are the most beautiful.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.240
Like this, I'll stand out more than Kenshin.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.730
Well done, Hideyoshi.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.820
Good work.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:10.920
My lord, my lord, my lord.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.770
Good girl.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.340
Good girl?

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:16.220
I hope everyone's OK...

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.600
That's the signal for it to start!

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:27.600
I guess I'll just have to see what happens.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.700
Mitsuhide, you've fallen in love 
with me, haven't you?

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.420
Akerin, it's your turn!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:38.450
Right.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:39.780
Mitsuhide!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.370
Where are you, Mitsuhide?!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.880
I'm right here!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.620
Oh, no!

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.920
Are you OK, Akerin!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.050
You're a good girl, too, Hideyoshi.

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:54.720
What's wrong?

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.200
Did we change the script?

00:17:56.200 --> 00:17:59.760
OK... You're a good girl, Hideyoshi!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.490
Don't be embarrassed, Hideyoshi.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:07.780
I love you, Kenshin!

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:09.540
Me, too, Shingen!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.780
<i>I'm a bigger star than Kenshin.</i>

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.530
<i>They're screaming louder 
for me than for Shingen.</i>

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.580
You are too beautiful.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.830
Your face, your form, your legs...

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.570
I'm sorry I'm so beautiful!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:32.670
I shall see my lord's plan succeed!

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.930
It's time for the last scene.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:40.430
Let's all do our best!

00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:42.880
<i>This time!</i>

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.680
<i>This time, I'll do it!</i>

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:47.430
<i>It's almost time.</i>

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:50.770
<i>She isn't really going to do it, is she?</i>

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:55.780
Lord, as you ordered, I changed Nobunaga's script!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.690
But that's too easy.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.900
There must be some way I can help...

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:06.300
Oh, look! A piece of flint!

00:19:07.270 --> 00:19:09.190
OK, I'm ready whenever.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.210
Raise the curtain.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.320
I'll help you, my lord!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:22.540
I may have overdone it.

00:19:24.780 --> 00:19:28.270
Hanzou...

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:35.670
Everyone!

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:36.510
Nobunaga-dono!

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.220
Over here, everyone!

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.320
My lord!

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.700
No!

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:44.460
Save me!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.110
Someone, save me!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:46.870
Hideyoshi!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:48.360
Hideyoshi-chan!

00:19:48.360 --> 00:19:50.030
My lord hasn't shown up, either!

00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:56.820
Hideyoshi!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:08.760
My lord!

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:15.810
Darn you!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:19.400
My lord!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:24.900
My lord!

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.950
I won't let anyone die on my land!

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.400
This is it.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:00.040
I made what you told me to.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.520
It totally worked!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:06.570
I won't let anyone die on my land!

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.440
So cool...

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:10.410
My turn next!

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.940
And to think, the play was ruined.

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:20.840
It wasn't ruined. It was a huge success, my lord.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:23.550
The people were all so happy.

00:21:23.550 --> 00:21:24.510
That's right.

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:27.640
So, Masamune, what did you have to tell me?

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:31.770
Actually, I've located the remaining pieces 
of the Crimson Armor.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:32.880
What?

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.600
The remaining three are in Saigoku.

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.020
I've sent a letter.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:41.530
Once you have them, all the armor will be yours!

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.440
I see.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.280
It's finally time to unify the land.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.800
<b>Hideyoshino 
Hidaka Rina</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:28.800
<b>Date-Sensei 
Hirata Yuka</b>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:52.450
<b>Sengoku Otome Style Preview</b>

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:26.990
1,2,3...

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:31.090
Battle Maidens, blooming bright,

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.820
fly through the sky brilliantly.

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:37.860
Blot the full moon out with crimson!

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:40.420
Battle Maidens, petals falling,

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:44.410
fly up into the sky beautifully.

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:50.860
A blue flame tearing apart 
the floating world's illusions,

00:23:50.860 --> 00:23:52.450
a shimmering haze.

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.540
Watch next time, OK?

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:54.480
Preview

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:54.480
Fever Maiden
